{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.poster.avif?t=1753405210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.webm?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.mp4?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When reality breaks, how much can your mind be trusted?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runway: 66</strong> is a psychological horror and sci-fi experience that follows <strong>Gabriel</strong>, who falls into a coma after a deadly plane crash and wakes up as <strong>Subject 66</strong> in a government-backed mental simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this artificial universe, you will embark on a <strong>7-chapter journey</strong> spanning from an <strong>abandoned airport filled with shadows of the past to mysterious military facilities, labyrinthine caves, and areas where time shatters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, not only lost memories await you but also the AI codenamed Maryam, which leads to mental collapse, unraveling reality, and suppressed secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.poster.avif?t=1753405210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.webm?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.mp4?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f DYNAMIC AI TRACKING</strong><br>Artificial intelligence <strong>Meryem</strong> adapts to your behavior; it turns off the lights, hunts you with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 SURVIVAL WITHOUT WAR &amp; PUZZLE</strong><br>There is no war; hide, flee, and outsmart the simulation's loopholes with your intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong><br>Your choices lead to <strong>3 radical endings</strong>: <strong>Awakening, Surrender, or Loss.</strong>&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;<strong>\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f ATMOSPHERIC SECTIONS</strong><br>Foggy runways, sinkholes, ruined infirmaries, and deep psychological horror themes in dark labyrinths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccd FLUID MAP DESIGN</strong><br>With its optimized and modular structure, the large map provides high performance and smooth exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.poster.avif?t=1753405210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.webm?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.mp4?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 WHY RUNWAY: 66?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 <strong>A unique experience blending psychological horror + science fiction</strong> genres<br>\u2713 A world deepened with <strong>environmental storytelling</strong><br>\u2713 Survival focused on <strong>intelligence and strategy</strong>, without war<br>\u2713 Exploration and replayability in <strong>7 episodes</strong><br>\u2713 <strong>Cinematic atmosphere</strong> and optimized performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runway: 66 \u2013 Get ready to embark on an unforgettable journey through the dark labyrinths of your mind.</strong><br><i>Remember: Terminal 66 exists because you forgot.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Morning\u2026  ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/8ac77eef07d472487cee95beb0332ea6974eaac2.jpg"},{"name":"Is that my Mommy?   ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/c51168e58c048c9bc9e06b4e62b5a5c6cb7037c1.jpg"},{"name":"Jack In The Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/a5b23c8a8f6e429d0f71d7c1ba400c39fa65ccac.jpg"},{"name":"C++ OR C#","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/db0a451e86131986a89135d6c6938ada5214111a.jpg"},{"name":"Too Cold To Fight    ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/2c988d84bf9b5177b22bb902e323055a1e894071.jpg"},{"name":"Smells Like BT ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/096a41cad62a9eb2cee80dd6f677f71e3594d4c0.jpg"},{"name":"A Way Out?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/c7b74a4d9657ba987a7d1290ba63c81d7416f778.jpg"},{"name":"That's a Hell of a party\u2026 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/135151ab9f4388375cb068d55e743df2594e796f.jpg"},{"name":"Beep Boop Bap Bop ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea