 breaks, how much can your mind be trusted?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runway: 66</strong> is a psychological horror and sci-fi experience that follows <strong>Gabriel</strong>, who falls into a coma after a deadly plane crash and wakes up as <strong>Subject 66</strong> in a government-backed mental simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this artificial universe, you will embark on a <strong>7-chapter journey</strong> spanning from an <strong>abandoned airport filled with shadows of the past to mysterious military facilities, labyrinthine caves, and areas where time shatters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, not only lost memories await you but also the AI codenamed Maryam, which leads to mental collapse, unraveling reality, and suppressed secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.poster.avif?t=1753405210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.webm?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.mp4?t=1753405210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f DYNAMIC AI TRACKING</strong><br>Artificial intelligence <strong>Meryem</strong> adapts to your behavior; it turns off the lights, hunts you with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 SURVIVAL WITHOUT WAR &amp; PUZZLE</strong><br>There is no war; hide, flee, and outsmart the simulation's loopholes with your intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong